  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da8931931299a883",
      "translationZh": "家里的 A4 纸用完了，于是我让 TensorSharp（一个开源的本地 LLM 推理引擎和智能体运行时）访问我的 Amazon 账户，并只对它说：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c2d1d911e96c36d",
      "translationZh": "请登录我的 Amazon 账户，搜索价格较低、折扣最优惠的 A4 纸，然后购买。请尽你所能处理好一切。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5352fcd5c56996f",
      "translationZh": "它一次运行就成功完成了整个任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aebf35244a1135ba",
      "translationZh": "在本地运行的 Qwen3.8 27B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8dd02a1208efcf0d",
      "translationZh": "TensorSharp 推理引擎 + 智能体运行时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "450e12a8e926fc17",
      "translationZh": "用于浏览器自动化的 Playwright 技能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df703d0ba2326597",
      "translationZh": "我只在登录 Amazon 和批准最终购买时介入。搜索、比较商品、浏览 Amazon 以及准备订单，全都由它自主完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4c6d8b20962812d",
      "translationZh": "除了访问 Amazon 本身之外，一切都在本地进行——模型推理、推理思考、智能体状态和工具执行。你的数据就是你的数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e73794e441d657e4",
      "translationZh": "视频包含完整的原始推理/工具调用轨迹，包括浏览器指令和生成的 Playwright 代码。为了节省时间，视频以 8× 倍速播放。实际运行耗时约 24 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7520c6b177d21f42",
      "translationZh": "由于本地推理速度和 iOS 浏览器限制，iPhone 上的 TensorAgent 仍有待改进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
